      <p>She plans, ships, and watches live systems from this Root Server home. Player features go through votes; bugs get verified, then fixed. In-game money stays <strong>Gold</strong>; real support stays on the Pro pages. Part runtime, part character — built to keep the gaming servers advancing with less babysitting over time.</p>
